@startuml DP-01
title DP-01 - Diagrama de paquetes del backend

' Dependencias reales entre paquetes de com.uo289390.toco, sacadas de los
' imports del código. Una flecha A ..> B significa "A importa algo de B".
' Se omiten:
'   - los imports que solo sirven para un {@link} del Javadoc
'     (controller y utils -> exception, SpotifyAuthController -> security,
'     UserController -> model.Preferences);
'   - el atajo puntual de controller hacia model y utils.mapper en
'     RecommendationController (Genre, InstrumentGenre, DtoMapper).
' controller -> security no es un import: es la expresión SpEL @ownership
' (OwnershipChecker) de los @PreAuthorize.
' Capas y reglas: architecture.md (§1). Frontend en DP02_paquetes_frontend.puml.
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam packageStyle folder
set separator none
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam package {
    BackgroundColor<<backend>> #FFF9F0
    BorderColor<<backend>> #B07A1F
}
skinparam ArrowColor #555555

package "com.uo289390.toco" <<backend>> {

    package "controller" as b_controller {
    }
    package "exception" as b_exception {
    }

    package "service" as b_service {
        package "recommendation" as b_recommendation {
        }
    }

    package "dto" as b_dto {
        package "validation" as b_validation {
        }
    }

    package "repository" as b_repository {
    }
    package "model" as b_model {
    }

    package "utils" as b_utils {
        package "mapper" as b_mapper {
        }
    }

    package "security" as b_security {
    }
    package "config" as b_config {
    }
}

b_exception ..> b_controller : <<intercepta>>

b_controller ..> b_service
b_controller ..> b_recommendation
b_controller ..> b_dto
b_controller ..> b_validation
b_controller ..> b_security : <<SpEL @ownership>>
b_controller ..> b_utils : <<RecommendationConstants>>

b_service ..> b_repository
b_service ..> b_model
b_service ..> b_dto
b_service ..> b_utils
b_service ..> b_mapper
b_service ..> b_security
b_service ..> b_config

b_recommendation ..> b_repository
b_recommendation ..> b_model
b_recommendation ..> b_dto
b_recommendation ..> b_utils
b_recommendation ..> b_mapper
b_recommendation ..> b_service : <<SpotifyAuthService>>

b_repository ..> b_model
b_dto ..> b_model
b_dto ..> b_validation : <<OnCreate>>
b_mapper ..> b_model
b_mapper ..> b_dto
b_utils ..> b_repository
b_utils ..> b_model
b_model ..> b_utils : «Identifiable, Utils,\nRecommendationConstants»

b_security ..> b_model
b_security ..> b_utils
b_config ..> b_security
b_config ..> b_repository
b_config ..> b_model


legend bottom left
  |= Paquete |= Contenido |
  | controller | Controladores REST: solo HTTP (rutas, parámetros, códigos de respuesta) |
  | exception | GlobalExceptionHandler (@RestControllerAdvice): excepción -> respuesta HTTP |
  | utils | EntityResolver, Utils, RecommendationConstants, Identifiable |
  | utils.mapper | DtoMapper (entidad -> DTO) y EntityMapper (DTO -> entidad) |
  | security | JwtAuthenticationFilter, JwtUtil, OwnershipChecker |
  | config | SecurityConfig, AdminBootstrap, SpotifyProperties, AppConfig |
endlegend

@enduml
